# Module 02: Wazuh SIEM Deployment & Virtualized Infrastructure Networking

## 📌 Executive Summary
This module documents the initial deployment, resource optimization, and virtual networking configuration for a dual-VM security monitoring lab running locally via Oracle VirtualBox. The lab architecture establishes an attacker instance (**Kali Linux**) monitored by an enterprise-grade SIEM/EDR platform (**Wazuh Manager v4.14.7**).

---

## 📐 Lab Architecture & Resource Allocation

| Component | OS / Appliance | Role | vCPU Allocation | RAM Allocation | Network Adapter |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Attacker Endpoint** | Kali Linux 2026.x | Endpoint / Target | 2 Cores | 2048 MB (2 GB) | NAT Network (`NatNetwork`) |
